<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>QR Absensi - Hadiriin</title><style>body{background:#100c12;color:#fff;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0}nav{background:#171119;padding:18px 6%;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}a{color:#ff54ad;text-decoration:none}main{max-width:1000px;margin:30px auto;padding:0 18px}h1{color:#ff54ad}.panel{background:#1b151e;border:1px solid #713052;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}input,select,button{padding:12px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid #713052;margin:6px;background:#251a28;color:white;font-size:15px}button{background:#a52d70;cursor:pointer}button:hover{background:#c83b8a}.success{color:#77e7a0}.error{color:#ff8f9c}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #473347;text-align:left}.muted{color:#b5a5b5}#qr{background:white;padding:16px;display:inline-block;border-radius:10px}video{max-width:100%}@media(max-width:600px){table{font-size:12px}td,th{padding:6px}}</style></head><body><nav><strong>Hadiriin.</strong><a href="{{ route('dosen.dashboard') }}">Dashboard Dosen</a><a href="{{ route('dosen.qr.index') }}">Absensi Scan QR</a></nav><main><h1>Absensi Scan QR</h1><p class="muted">Buat sesi absensi untuk kelas yang Anda ampu.</p>@if(session('success'))<p class="success">{{session('success')}}</p>@endif
